{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Gantry + vision + red / blue\nSimple stages: build → generate → train → battle → physical validation.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 1340,
      "height": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "gantry-group",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Gantry build",
      "x": -20,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 900,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "vision-group",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Vision + data",
      "x": 440,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 900,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "teams-group",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Red / blue trials",
      "x": 900,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 900,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "g1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · Build and identify\nInventory frame, motors, stylus and phone fixtures.\nIdentify controller and protocol before connection.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · Controller + stop\nTest fake acknowledgements, limits and typed intents.\nPhysical stop, endstops and homing remain pending.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 235,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "g3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 · Camera + calibration\nMap pixels to each phone fixture.\nVerify held-out points, fresh frames and interior bounds.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "g4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · Supervised commissioning\nCheck unloaded motion, then owned-phone contact.\nRecord touch, drag and stop performance.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 665,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "v1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · Generate iPhone sportsbook pages\nBlue app exports fictional records and update sequences.\nRenderer-tagged images, truth and measured field borders.",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "v2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · Tag, border and split\nStable IDs + images + YOLO labels + pixel borders.\nImmutable tags; audit layout/device/font separation.",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 235,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "v3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 · Train detector + OCR + extraction\nOCR/association/database baseline now records misses.\nExpanded-role detector training is next; rank verified losses.",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "v4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · Score stored records\nReopen SQLite; score exact rows, prices and joins.\nKeep missing, wrong and stale fields plus error evidence.",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 665,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · Red acts from pixels\nFrozen detector + OCR → typed calibrated intentions.\nNo evaluator labels; fresh-frame / confidence gates.",
      "x": 920,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · Blue observes contacts\nOnly website coordinates, timing and pointer events.\nFrozen descriptive patterns; human controls pending.",
      "x": 920,
      "y": 235,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 · Run matched rounds\nSame model, layouts and seeds; declared browser profiles.\nScore blue first, then join independent outcomes.",
      "x": 920,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · Inspect the scoreboard\nRed completions / wrong actions / refusals + blue flags.\nLocalhost:8767; patterns are hypotheses, no sanctions.",
      "x": 920,
      "y": 665,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "integrate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5 · Connect the physical rig\nReplace fake acknowledgements only after commissioning.\nKeep lab camera/motor traces separate from provider contacts.",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "next",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6 · Improve from recorded failures\nMine training misses; preserve unseen provider/device holdouts.\nTest a small extraction LLM only if association errors justify it.",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 1200,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "proposal",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "docs/gantry/End-to-End Proposal.md",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1470,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "app-guide",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "packages/phone_lab/README.md",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 1470,
      "width": 600,
